Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back. You've done well.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.00,0:00:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,As I said, there are signs your mind is split.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.00,0:00:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You've reacted very differently during your visits.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.00,0:00:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'd like to ask if you're curious
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.28,0:00:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,about the other sides of your personality.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to know who dominates your mind and actions right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.00,0:00:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That's okay. You can come back when you're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.00,0:00:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye for now.
